msgstr "Et gratis administrationsværktøjssæt til Simple File List"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:49
msgid ""
"The Simple File List Tools plugin provides professional debugging tools, "
"custom tweaks system, and administrative utilities to enhance your "
"development experience."
msgstr ""
"Pluginet „Simple File List Tools“ indeholder professionelle "
"fejlfindingsværktøjer, et system til brugerdefinerede justeringer samt "
"administrative hjælpeprogrammer, der forbedrer din udviklingsoplevelse."

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:51
msgid "Key Features:"
msgstr "Vigtigste funktioner:"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:61
msgid "Completely free for all Simple File List admins."
msgstr "Helt gratis for alle administratorer af Simple File List."

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:65
